	(lib_symbols)
	(text "51 VOICE SMART CAR - HARDWARE REVIEW\n\nScope: Existing PCB is unassembled. This sheet is a review index, not a PCB reconstruction.\nNo MCU GPIO, power trace, or PCB route is asserted as connected.\nMeasure the actual board unpowered before wiring or applying power."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 18 0)
		(effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "9200c1e5-fdc8-4b18-ae84-adbb4e15e3e0")
	)
	(text "SYSTEM BLOCKS (BOM / photographs)\n\nSTC89C52 DIP40 + 11.0592 MHz crystal\nReset and EA networks: PCB connectivity unverified\n\nMCU UART RXD <- one source only (PC/MAX232 OR voice TX)\nMCU UART TXD -> MAX232 transmit input (PCB path unverified)\n\nMCU control signals -> L293D inputs/enables (GPIO mapping unknown)\nL293D outputs -> M1/M2 (left/right assignment unknown)\n\nDC6V label does not prove a safe MCU logic supply"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 50 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.65 1.65)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "910f7036-6f73-40ee-aa73-1d2db12da1bc")
	)
	(text "DESIGN REVIEW / MEASURE BEFORE USE\n\n[ MCU core ]  socket / crystal / reset / EA; all board routes pending\n[ MAX232 ]    RS-232 level converter; verify its 5 V supply rail\n[ L293D ]     pins 1/9 enable; pin 16 logic supply; pin 8 motor supply\n[ SU-03T ]    candidate offline voice board; variant and UART pending\n[ AA pack ]   voltage varies with cell chemistry and discharge state\n\nUART safety: PC/MAX232 and SU-03T must never drive MCU RXD together.\nSelect modes with power off and measure isolation of the unselected TX.\nInitial voice path is one-way TX -> MCU RXD; voltage compatibility pending.\n\nPOWER SAFETY: measure DC6V input to IC1-40, IC2-16, IC3-16/8 first.\nConfirm regulation, common ground, motor rail, and startup droop before use."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 155 18 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "67b298f1-8849-4500-9f48-55071b6d36d9")
	)
	(text "PIN CHECKLIST (standard IC pins; PCB net assignment unknown)\n\nMCU DIP40: 40 VCC / 20 GND / 18 XTAL2 / 19 XTAL1 / 9 RST / 31 EA\nMCU UART: 10 RXD / 11 TXD\nL293D: 2,7,10,15 inputs; 1,9 enables; 3,6,11,14 outputs\nL293D: 16 VCC1 logic / 8 VCC2 motor / 4,5,12,13 GND\nMAX232: 16 VCC / 15 GND / 12,9 R1OUT/R2OUT / 11,10 T1IN/T2IN\n\nMeasurement instructions: docs/HARDWARE_AUDIT.md and PINOUT_TRACE.csv.\nThis sheet has no electrical nets. Empty netlist and clean ERC mean only\nthat this review file exports; they do not verify PCB wiring, safe power,\nor vehicle operation."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 155 76 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "ce7bcb46-65dc-4c56-a4a5-254db57be8bf")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
